From 6ba59d85da2efd55039757763d21724e3ef9f17f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VIT Civil Engineering Innovation Lab <lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 02:37:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Streamlit student and teacher apps; Node 24 actions; Pages
 refresh after open/close

Student app (apps/student): typed-only Java Lab with the website's editor and typing log,
Run and Check on the real JDK 21 (Temurin 21.0.13+9, SHA-256 verified), every course program
incl. files, serialization and JDBC (jdbc:mysql on H2 in MySQL mode); same encrypted package
and GitHub-issue submission as lab.html; holds no secret.
Sandbox: warm compile server, one JVM per run under the Java 21 Security Manager, prlimit
CPU/address-space/file-size limits, wall-clock timeout, output caps, 4 run slots.

Teacher app (apps/teacher): sessions open/close (lab-control.yml), live submissions,
gradebook marking (collect.yml), marks and similarity, replay, new questions with hidden
cases made on Java 21, key pair.

Workflows: first Node 24 major of every action, runners pinned to ubuntu-24.04; lab-control
republishes the website after open/close; CI job streamlit-apps.
lab.js: jittered polling, 10-minute fallback to the website copy after GitHub 403/429.
Guide 11, README, NOTICE.
