+// Java 21 Security Manager; ${lab.work} is the program's own fresh working folder.
+// Not granted: files outside that folder, network, processes, reflection on private members,
+// class loaders, environment variables (except the three of Experiment 16), native code.
+// Libraries supplied by the app (H2 and the jdbc:mysql shim of Experiment 16).
+grant codeBase "file:${lab.lib}/-" {
